{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"function resumeServerSentEventsResponse<TOffset>(options): Response;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/stream-to-response.ts#L1179","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/stream-to-response.ts:1179"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Serve a resumable run from its durability log over Server-Sent Events, without\nre-running the model. Use this in a "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"GET"},{"type":"text","value":" handler so a reload or a second tab\ncan re-attach to an in-flight or finished run."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The adapter ("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"memoryStream(request)"},{"type":"text","value":" / "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"durableStream(request)"},{"type":"text","value":") captures the\nresume offset from the request. If there is none (no "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Last-Event-ID"},{"type":"text","value":" header\nand no "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"?offset"},{"type":"text","value":"), there is nothing to replay and this returns a 400."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"toffset","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TOffset"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TOffset"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"options","children":[{"type":"text","value":"options"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ResumeResponseOptions"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TOffset"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Response"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"export async function GET(request: Request) {\n  return resumeServerSentEventsResponse({ adapter: memoryStream(request) });\n}","lang":"typescript"}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"toffset","text":"TOffset","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"options","text":"options","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction resumeServerSentEventsResponse<TOffset>(options): Response;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/stream-to-response.ts:1179](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/stream-to-response.ts#L1179)\n\nServe a resumable run from its durability log over Server-Sent Events, without\nre-running the model. Use this in a `GET` handler so a reload or a second tab\ncan re-attach to an in-flight or finished run.\n\nThe adapter (`memoryStream(request)` / `durableStream(request)`) captures the\nresume offset from the request. If there is none (no `Last-Event-ID` header\nand no `?offset`), there is nothing to replay and this returns a 400.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TOffset\n\n`TOffset` *extends* `string` = `string`\n\n## Parameters\n\n### options\n\n`ResumeResponseOptions`\\<`TOffset`\\>\n\n## Returns\n\n`Response`\n\n## Example\n\n```typescript\nexport async function GET(request: Request) {\n  return resumeServerSentEventsResponse({ adapter: memoryStream(request) });\n}\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: resumeServerSentEventsResponse\ntitle: resumeServerSentEventsResponse\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction resumeServerSentEventsResponse<TOffset>(options): Response;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/stream-to-response.ts:1179](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/stream-to-response.ts#L1179)\n\nServe a resumable run from its durability log over Server-Sent Events, without\nre-running the model. Use this in a `GET` handler so a reload or a second tab\ncan re-attach to an in-flight or finished run.\n\nThe adapter (`memoryStream(request)` / `durableStream(request)`) captures the\nresume offset from the request. If there is none (no `Last-Event-ID` header\nand no `?offset`), there is nothing to replay and this returns a 400.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TOffset\n\n`TOffset` *extends* `string` = `string`\n\n## Parameters\n\n### options\n\n`ResumeResponseOptions`\\<`TOffset`\\>\n\n## Returns\n\n`Response`\n\n## Example\n\n```typescript\nexport async function GET(request: Request) {\n  return resumeServerSentEventsResponse({ adapter: memoryStream(request) });\n}\n```\n"}
